fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstquery.html#gst_query_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_query_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Query.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Query.is_writable\n\nTests if you can safely modify query. It is only safe to modify query when\nthere is only one owner of the query - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na GstQuery\nTests if you can safely modify query. It is only safe to modify query when\nthere is only one owner of the query - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Query\nTests if you can safely modify query. It is only safe to modify query when\nthere is only one owner of the query - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Query\n"});